From 1843033a732a8033c0a41540ea807540915d905b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HYUNSOL MUN <muumthf@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:41:06 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kcsan: execute candidate policy per campaign

Select one candidate policy from the manager payload and register it in each VM
before starting the runner. Carry the manager's candidate ID through regular and
snapshot execution requests to the policy generation ioctl.

Keep program representations independent of the campaign. Leave feature probes,
comparison-only executions and ordinary jobs on the original generation path.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
